{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Ashen Blade&quot; is a third-person action game with high difficulty boss battles only, where you fight using parry and evasion. The player awakens as a knight who was once called a hero but fell into a long-sealed slumber, and challenges a deadly battle with a powerful enemy in a world of ashes burned by dragon flames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game features challenging boss battles and tense sword action. You can enjoy the exhilaration of predicting attacks, parrying, and defeating a powerful enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Main features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Precise parry action: The exhilaration of judging the timing and parrying a powerful blow from an enemy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fierce boss battles: Tension-filled battles with powerful enemies with unique behavior patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One-way action experience: A pure combat-only action game with no exploration elements</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3604350?t=1744235657","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3604350?t=1744235657","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604350/0101127c5cd3c35eafa42ef81ddfa33f1e850ec3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744235657","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604350/0101127c5cd3c35eafa42ef81ddfa33f1e850ec3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744235657","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Ashen Blade&quot; is a third-person action game with high difficulty boss battles only, where you fight using parry a